---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import profile from '../data/profile.json';
---
<Layout title="Suyog KC — Developer & Technical Lead" description={profile.summary} image="/images/suyog-waterfront.png">
  <section class="about-page wrap">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Developer. Technical lead. Curious human.</p>
      <h1>Hi, I’m Suyog.<br />I build, and help<br />others build.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Thoughtful software starts with understanding the problem.</p>
      <div class="prose"><p>{profile.summary}</p><p>Outside work, I make room for books, getting outside, and a change of perspective. This journal holds a little of both worlds.</p></div>
      <div class="profile-actions"><a class="pill-link" href="/resume/">View résumé <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/suyog-kc-resume.pdf" download>Download PDF</a></div>
    </div>
    <figure><img src="/images/suyog-waterfront.png" alt="Suyog by the waterfront" width="480" height="580" /><figcaption>A little space to think.</figcaption></figure>
  </section>
  <section class="profile-section wrap" aria-labelledby="approach-title">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">How I work</p><h2 id="approach-title">Clear intent. Careful execution.</h2></div></div>
    <div class="profile-grid">
      <article><span aria-hidden="true">⌘</span><h3>Understand the system</h3><p>Trace the actual behaviour and its callers before choosing a solution. Reuse what already works.</p></article>
      <article><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><h3>Make progress reviewable</h3><p>Keep scope clear, split work at useful boundaries, and give the next person enough context to decide.</p></article>
      <article><span aria-hidden="true">✳</span><h3>Verify the result</h3><p>Use agents with explicit ownership and checks. Distinguish what was tested from what remains uncertain.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="profile-section wrap" aria-labelledby="experience-title">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Experience</p><h2 id="experience-title">Building products and teams.</h2></div></div>
    <div class="experience-list">{profile.experience.map(item => <article><div><p class="eyebrow">{item.period}</p><h3>{item.company}</h3><p>{item.role}</p></div><ul>{item.points.map(point => <li>{point}</li>)}</ul></article>)}</div>
  </section>
  <section class="profile-section wrap" aria-labelledby="work-title">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Selected public work</p><h2 id="work-title">Things you can explore.</h2></div></div>
    <div class="profile-grid project-grid">{profile.projects.map(project => <article><h3><a href={project.url}>{project.name} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></h3><p>{project.description}</p></article>)}</div>
    <div class="profile-actions"><a class="pill-link" href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>Let’s talk <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href={profile.github}>GitHub</a><a class="text-link" href={profile.linkedin}>LinkedIn</a></div>
  </section>
</Layout>
